  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/cmr_banner\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://discord.gg/nFBAXfb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=555555&labelColor=5865f2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://github.com/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=555555&labelColor=000000&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=555555&labelColor=FF0000&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/iglee42/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=555555&labelColor=f16436&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252figlee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=555555&labelColor=1ace65&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:30px\"><span style=\"color:#808080;font-size:30px\">Create More Recipes</span> 是 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><a style=\"font-weight:normal !important;color:#f90;font-size:30px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Mod</a> </span><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此擴增模組添加與 Create 相關的新配方<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">目前支援的 Create 版本：6.0.10</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#fc0\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">靈感來自 <a style=\"font-size:24px\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrMLDEG\" rel=\"nofollow\">MLDEG</a></span><br></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:30px\">配方類型<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">風扇自訂方塊：<br></span></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:left\"><code>{\n  \"type\": \"cmr:custom_fan\",\n  \"ingredients\": [\n    {\n      \"tag\": \"c:cobblestone\" //投擲的物品\n    },\n    {\n      \"item\": \"minecraft:oak_fence\" //風扇後方的方塊（若有流體則為選填）\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"fluid_stack\",\n      \"amount\": 1000,\n      \"fluid\": \"create:honey\" //流體（若有方塊則為選填）\n    }\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"item\": {\n        \"id\": \"minecraft:diamond\" //結果物品\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}</code></pre>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">方塊噴湧：<br></span></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:left\"><code>{\n  \"type\": \"cmr:block_spouting\",\n  \"ingredients\": [\n    {\n      \"item\": \"minecraft:dirt\" //噴湧下方的方塊\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"fluid_stack\",\n      \"amount\": 500, //流體數量\n      \"fluid\": \"minecraft:water\" //噴湧中的流體\n    }\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"item\": {\n        \"id\": \"minecraft:grass_block\" //輸出的方塊\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}</code></pre>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/541199/description_4e1cb9c4-bc3f-41dd-8136-0e734888fb1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">您可以將本模组用於您的模组包，但請勿將此模组重新發佈至其他網站！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Curseforge 是唯一發布此模组的網站</span>\n</div>",
